# Unique design

Load `frontend-design` and `parallax-portfolio-craft` before generating UI.

- Ground type, color, and motion in the subject's actual work and materials.
- Custom tokens (named hex + type roles). Do not ship unthemed shadcn zinc.
- One signature motion or layout device. Cut competing effects.
- Type pairing is part of the brand. Avoid Inter, Space Grotesk, Syne, Clash Display as the whole identity.
- Reject: gradient orbs, identical project cards, skill-pill clouds, "Hi I'm X" heroes, fake 01–03 indexes, glassmorphism-for-its-own-sake.
- Copy is design material. Specific, active, no SaaS filler.
- `text-wrap: balance` on headings. Visible `:focus-visible`. Semantic landmarks (`header`, `main`, `nav`).
- Dark theme needs `color-scheme: dark` and matching `theme-color`.